{"id":"vod_sn_37980","vodId":"37980","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"星梦手记","name_cn":"星梦手记","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/6ecaed9f3a433bb5d94f44f5a64e0e73.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在不远的未来时代，彼时，VR技术的普及让人们即使身处家中也可以体验到精彩绝伦的偶像演出，技术的发展也使得人们对偶像的需求和依赖日益增加。世界各地都建立起了专门培育偶像的学校。　　故事发生在由天然岛与人工岛连结而构成的起始之岛上，在这里，矗立着一座拥有悠久历史的偶像培训学校，曾经，无数的偶像作为新星从其中冉冉升起，但随着时间的推移，这所学校的人气渐渐低迷。个性开朗率真，不擅长掩饰自己心情的林薇薇（丰田萌绘 配音）、性格沉稳，总是以前辈形象出现的服部惺梛（早濑莉花 配音）、因为憧憬曾祖母而立志成为偶像的早川心樱（木村优 配音），这些活跃在学校里的女孩子们，是否能够完成他们的梦想呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:57:16","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/H34FGPPZJ11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/T3FxEBSvRb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4tk7SmGr0P1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1PDn9LutBG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0LCY5ASmQs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/E1EsbEsSkG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Sjbp6Wv7Up1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/p9SCTB897z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/78RxDNBdCa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uyJc13UrRC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZSNr5WnXQr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wL7RSji4Vf1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:04.328Z"}